Description: Google Drive desktop client for GNOME/Linux
 Kitelink brings a Google Drive Desktop–like experience to GNOME Files
 (Nautilus): branded folder, approximate sync emblems, and calm tray
 progress for large downloads.
 .
 Phase 1 orchestrates rclone mount behind a D-Bus service. Requires a
 Google OAuth Desktop client configured via
 KITELINK_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID and KITELINK_GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET.
